title: "CNRS Scientific Toolkit"
message: "CNRS means Complex Numeric Representation System. Version 0.19.0 is a release-activation candidate adding exact finite-value comparison and pinned Lean-checked addition correspondence controls. Python remains independently implemented; no end-to-end formal verification is claimed."
